<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l><l>’Neath His wings protecting hide you,</l><l>Daily manna still provide you;</l><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l><l>When life’s perils thick confound you,</l><l>Put His arms unfailing round you;</l><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l><l>Keep love’s banner floating o’er you,</l><l>Smite death’s threatening wave before you;</l><l>God be with you till we meet again!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
